{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1801.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7af9f42577286003382586dc347cdb73ca840f7f1b3e049deaa44698f648eef0","ja":"今日は、いつもとちょっと違うゲームを\n用意したんだ！","zh":"今天准备了一个和往常稍微有点不一样的游戏！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1801.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d5a6ee4a7c871394d5ea8d0750a859177fe9561fdb867761593769b90fbf8874","ja":"じゃーん！　アクションと推理が混在する\nハードボイルドアクションゲームでーす！","zh":"锵锵！这是一款动作与推理相结合的硬派动作游戏！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1801.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ccd4ce7b9510de5630d49a405d57026f228765905343c159113001ce186c742c","ja":"えっ、アクションと推理！\n私にできるかな～？","zh":"欸，动作和推理！\n我能做到吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1801.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"251267b0818f3371bec8758cd3232cbb5ae40776c14e0e47291d7475d5168d90","ja":"大丈夫！　基本的な操作は杏奈がするから、\n未来は、初見の素直なリアクションを見せて！","zh":"没问题！基本操作由杏奈来做，所以未来就展现一下第一次接触时最真实的反应吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1801.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4c05779f40e3ec1a450f19df7b6a11130d85f1b4b7cb3e829a9721f93f52e054","ja":"それに推理はちゃんとヒントも出るし、\n杏奈と一緒に考えたら、ビビッと事件解決だよ！","zh":"而且推理时也会好好给出提示，和杏奈一起思考的话，很快就能解决案件哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1801.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9d06cb59d33fcc8760fa6db6f94ffa0b5605097497ba0c2de77bbea1ad36a3af","ja":"本当？　それならちょっと頑張っちゃおうかな！","zh":"真的？那样的话，我就稍微努力一下吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1801.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4f248fdc38195372144e9b316d528eafafff2b37aafd73c91c84aa1d0aa7070d","ja":"準備はバッチリみたいだね♪\nそれじゃあ……ゲームスタート！！","zh":"准备得很充分呢♪  \n那么……游戏开始！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
